This directory holds the optional GWC/WASM progressive-enhancement bundle and
the checked-in profile-photo source assets used by the product demo.

Each profile photo has two deliberately different artifacts:

    person-<identity>.png        immutable uploaded/source original
    person-<identity>-small.jpg  160x160 display proxy

The browser-facing product projection and public asset allowlist reference
only the small proxy; originals are not web-routable.
The shared Avatar component adds loading="lazy" and decoding="async", so a
directory does not fetch off-screen portraits. The original remains available
to a future governed media pipeline for replacement proxy generation and is
never overwritten by that generation step.

To build the bundle into this directory:

    GOOS=js GOARCH=wasm go build -o internal/humanwork/workspace/assets/uxqual.wasm ./tools/uxqual/cmd/uxqualwasm
    cp "$(go env GOROOT)/lib/wasm/wasm_exec.js" internal/humanwork/workspace/assets/wasm_exec.js

Neither WASM file is committed: the server-rendered page is already the qualified
renderer (definitions/ux/workspace-renderer-decision.yaml), so a multi-megabyte
binary in the source tree would buy nothing a reader can see.
